--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHICH LICENSE APPLIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MIT License (see LICENSE-MIT) — the software:

  - Source code: *.gd, *.h, *.cpp, *.py, and shell/build scripts
  - Shaders: *.gdshader
  - Godot project, scene, and resource files: project.godot, *.tscn, *.tres,
    *.import, *.cfg, *.godot
  - Everything under engine/, scripts/, scenes/, test/, tools/, and bin/

  Godot scene and resource files are functional engine wiring (node graphs and
  parameter tables), not authored creative content, so they follow the code.

CC BY-SA 4.0 (see LICENSE-CC-BY-SA) — original creative works authored for this
project:

  - Documentation and design prose: *.md, everything under docs/, and the
    project's diagrams (e.g. *.drawio)
  - Original art authored for the project (e.g. icon.svg)

